加载 OpenFOAM v2512 环境后，将完整教程复制到新的工作目录。以下命令调用官方脚本，按算例顺序建立网格、初始化并求解。
mkdir -p "$FOAM_RUN"
cp -r "$FOAM_TUTORIALS/lagrangian/simpleReactingParcelFoam/verticalChannel" "$FOAM_RUN/verticalChannel-reference"
cd "$FOAM_RUN/verticalChannel-reference"
./Allrun
